			],
			"Message": "docs(Mist): Document all public items in Library, Resolver, WebSocket modules\n\nAdd comprehensive Rustdoc comments across three modules addressing documentation gaps identified in the nightly cargo doc build.\n\nLibrary.rs: Document the crate-level module with WebSocket Transport and Forward Security feature listings, add a Modules section enumerating each submodule's purpose, and add Links section pointing to the repository and architecture guide.\n\nResolver.rs: Document both the PascalCase New constructor (project convention) and the snake_case new alias (reqwest compatibility), clarifying when each variant should be used.\n\nWebSocket.rs: Document SharedSecret::random (thread-local RNG source), as_hex (64-char hex encoding), from_hex (error semantics for invalid input); HandlerRegistry::new (empty initial state), Register (replaces existing), Lookup (returns None for unregistered); and Client::is_closed (post-close invocation behaviour and recovery path).",
